  "description": "KAZAM CAPTURE AI — Zebra AI DataCapture SDK for .NET MAUI and .NET for Android.\n      Provides barcode decoding (44+ symbologies) and OCR text recognition on Zebra devices\n      via the Zebra AI DataCapture SDK 3.2.8.\n\n      For production: pass the JWT license issued by Suntech to ZebraAiScanner.Initialize().\n      For evaluation: pass the string \"DEMO\" (results partially obfuscated with asterisks).\n\n      Includes transitive dependencies: Kotlin stdlib, CameraX, AndroidX.",
